# Test: the external ExaBGP bridge runner (`ze exabgp plugin`) writes a script ExaBGP's shutdown line before the daemon stops
# VALIDATES: a script under `ze exabgp plugin`, which writes JSON, that sends
#            ExaBGP's `shutdown` reads `{"notification": "shutdown", "type":
#            "notification"}` on stdin before stdin closes (main_sdk.go
#            runSDKMode, after p.Run returns -> bridgerun Fleet.Shutdown ->
#            bridge.ShutdownLine). The engine stops a plugin with no `bye`
#            (ProcessManager.Stop).
# PREVENTS: a script stopped with no shutdown line, which ExaBGP always writes
#           (Processes.terminate, src/exabgp/reactor/api/processes.py)
# The helper waits for the neighbor's `up` state, sends `shutdown` (the bridge
# translates it to `request shutdown`), and fails unless the shutdown line follows.
# Linux only: the line reaches the script because a stop lets an external
# plugin exit on its own before its group is killed (pluginExitGrace), which
# needs waitid with WNOWAIT (exitwait_linux.go). Elsewhere the stop kills the
# group at once (exitwait_other.go), so the bridge rarely writes the line first.
option=needs-linux

# ze-peer expectations
stdin=peer:terminator=EOF_PEER
option=tcp_connections:value=1
option=timeout:value=15s
EOF_PEER

# ze bgp configuration
stdin=ze-bgp:terminator=EOF_CONF
plugin {
	external exabgp-bridge {
		run "ze exabgp plugin --family ipv4/unicast le test fixture plugin/exabgp-shutdown-helper json"
		encoder json
	}
}
bgp {
	peer peer1 {
		connection {
			remote {
				ip 127.0.0.1
			}
			local {
				ip 127.0.0.1
				accept false
			}
		}
		session {
			asn {
				local 1
				remote 1
			}
			router-id 1.2.3.4
			family {
				ipv4/unicast { prefix { maximum 10000; } }
			}
			capability {
				graceful-restart disable
			}
		}

		attach process exabgp-bridge {
			receive [ * ]
			send [ * ]
		}
	}
}
EOF_CONF

# Process orchestration
cmd=background:seq=1:exec=le test peer --mode sink --port $PORT:stdin=peer
cmd=foreground:seq=2:exec=ze -:stdin=ze-bgp:timeout=20s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=OK: exabgp shutdown line in json:
